    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "BLOCKING REVIEW - draft PR #418 is not a runtime PASS_CANDIDATE.\n\nDirect PR-head source review points to a likely split-state settlement failure at exactly vote #5:\n\n- `applyEscapeVoteTick()` calls `Game.Stage715Demo.persistOlegEscapeVoteProgress(b.id)` **before** `finalizeEscapeVote(b)` (AsyncScene/Web/conflict/conflict-core.js). \n- `persistOlegEscapeVoteProgress()` clones the still-pending `escapeVote` into `G.__S`, `stateFor()`, and `G.UI.S`; it does not synchronize the subsequent settled outcome.\n- `finalizeEscapeVote()` on a failed vote clears `b.escapeVote`, restores the battle state, and returns. The separate UI-state copy can still contain `escapeVote` with five voters.\n- `stage715BattleById()` searches UI state first and for Oleg escape **prefers the first battle with `escapeVote`**. `watchOlegEscape()` therefore may continue observing the stale pending clone instead of the settled authoritative battle. `settleOlegEscapeOutcome()` refuses to advance while a pending `escapeVote` exists.\n\nThis explains the reported visible 2:3 with no failure system/DM or restored escape card, but validate object identity and authoritative-vs-UI state in the exact native Codex browser reproduction before claiming definitive root cause.\n\nPlease continue the SAME Codex thread/branch/PR #418 (not a new PR), add a RED-first end-to-end lifecycle test that reproduces the observed 5th-vote failure using **distinct** Game.__S and Game.UI.S stores, and repair settlement synchronization/ownership at the actual source. Do not bypass the normal Core finalize/economy path or inject result UI. Verify the exact first attempt 2:3 -> failure system+DM+same card; second attempt 3:2 -> success system+DM -> gated independent-battle instruction; 1-2s visible per-vote delays, 2:2 after four votes, reload mid-vote, and exactly-once REP/money/messages, including reload after each settlement. Cover random Nastya first four votes and preserve existing timing. Only one native Codex Desktop browser tab, no Playwright/Chromium/external browser. Keep Web/docs mirrors exact and CI green. Leave PR as draft and do not merge until runtime complete, then mark ready for ChatGPT review; user Safari remains final acceptance. Atom 7 blocked.",
