    "body": "## Summary\n- Reveal Oleg escape votes one at a time from a persisted randomized sequence, and resume from the correct vote after reload.\n- Randomize Nastya's first four vote sides while preserving existing vote intervals and the 3:2 outcome.\n- Keep Web/docs copies identical and update focused regression coverage.\n\n## Validation\n- Focused Stage 7.15 Python regression tests pass.\n- Web/docs mirror parity, Node syntax checks, and `git diff --check` pass.\n- Codex Desktop single-tab runtime verification is incomplete: after reload, votes resumed and appeared incrementally, but the 5-vote loss did not reach its expected user-visible settled outcome. Do not treat this draft as PASS_CANDIDATE; runtime investigation and user Safari PASS remain required.\n\nAtom 7 is not started. No merge or Pages publication requested.",
